WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
07:30 — Add decant. Before the commute James adds a decant on his phone so it has a home — not another orphan vial in the desk drawer.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
12:00 — Collection iPad. Lunchtime iPad collection view shows what he actually owns versus what he thinks he owns.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
20:00 — Analytics laptop. Laptop analytics are illustrative only; he uses them to notice gaps, not to chase a score.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
20:40 — Advisor. Rules-based advisor tips on the laptop — not magic, just cues he can dismiss without guilt.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:00 — Phone check. Phone Today for tomorrow’s wear. The decant finally has a row in the catalogue.

